A||||15||KnightRyder31||Fiero vs. Geo Storm||||1||
Z||000000||KnightRyder31||11-15-2000||02:29 PM||||I was driving home from the girlfriends house around 10PM. I was on the highway(M59) and some fat kid in a Geo Storm gets next to me at a red light. He starts reving his engine at me and thumping his sub woffers at me. We both hammered it off the line, I got the jump on him. He kind of started to pull on me at 20MPH but as I was getting ready to shift into 2nd, I launched ahead of him. I got about 3-5 car lengths ahead of him when I hit 60MPH. By the time I hit 85MPH I was ahead by at least 10 car lengths. This was I rather lengthly race...about 10 miles. We would go at every light, I had fun...I laughed my A$$ off when I first seen the look on his face when I launched(I waved at him as I passed him)ahead.<BR>I'm proud of my Fiero!||||reg||1
Z||000001||1FST2M6||11-15-2000||02:40 PM||||HEH.. Nice kill! do these people REALLY think they have a chance in H#@L with all that Stereo weight in the car.. most people don't really pay atten to all that stuff together... mine was nearly 160lbs! thats CRAZY! thats another PERSON in the car.. making you slower and slower! not like he had a chance anyway...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   Nice kill! <P>------------------<BR>WOW... i've made chicken salad!!!||||reg||1
