Z||000003||DrRodey||11-15-2000||04:41 PM||||As an ex owner of a storm, knowing their performance ect., I would like to congratulate you. Yeah it was an easy kill, i'll admit it, Storms Suck for power but they are still cute little cars.  There are a few problems with them though.  First they weigh WAAAAAAAAAAY too much for their 1.9DOHC to handle. (given i did have mine over 110 a couple of times {going downhill with a tail wind})  Second they have Twice the wind resistance of our little beauties.  They were built primarily for economy, jsut like all other Geos.  They may look a little sporty but people (like our chubby litte bass pumper who got whooped here) have to realize that looks dont make a car go fast.<P>In conclusion...Congratulations on the kill.  Thank you for teaching that wanna-be racer whats for.  <P><P>------------------<BR>'88 Formula CONVERTABLE<BR>'85 Coupe<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://freepages.ugo.com/RodeysPlace/files/fieroPage.JPG">     <BR> <A HREF="http://freepages.ugo.com/RodeysPlace/HomePlace.html" TARGET=_blank>freepages.ugo.com/RodeysPlace/HomePlace.html</A>||||reg||1
